🎃 BLOXNOTE

A game of deception, deduction, and teamwork.

🎭 4 ROLES: Kira, Kira Follower, L & Investigator.

**INVESTIGATOR** — Complete all tasks to win while working alongside L to find Kira.

**L** — Assist the Investigators and help uncover Kira before they can DELETE everyone.

**KIRA & KIRA FOLLOWER** — Work together to DELETE all players and specifically DELETE L to win.

🏆 Find Kira before it's too late, or DELETE everyone standing in your way.

💻📱🎮 Works on all devices: PC, Console, Mobile.

